WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.750
Handle an offer conversation. Review the full package, prepare a specific request, and give yourself time to make a clear decision.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.500
Review. Look beyond base pay. Consider benefits, bonus, equity, schedule, location, growth, and the review cycle.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.250
Research. Build a reasonable range. Use role scope, location, experience, and reliable market data to prepare your request.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:19.000
Ask. Be specific and positive. Show enthusiasm, name the adjustment you want, and support it with relevant evidence.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.750
Pause. Give the conversation room. After making the request, stop talking and let the other person respond.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:28.500
Confirm. Review the final terms. Ask for the complete offer in writing and take the agreed time to consider it.
